identifier: Keystone
name: Keystone
abstract: >-
  The base a family of small mods stands on: one settings window for all of
  them, settings that are kept between runs, and a lens of its own (depth of
  field, motion blur, grain) for the mods that film.
author: Ishiaki
$kref: '#/ckan/github/IshiakiZ/ksp-keystone'
$vref: '#/ckan/ksp-avc'
